---
source: src/cli/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Print the snapshot path for a model/revision (refs/ lookup with an online fallback; scripting helper)

Usage: path [OPTIONS] <MODEL_ID>

Arguments:
  <MODEL_ID>
          Model ID, e.g. "Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct"

Options:
      --revision <REV>
          Git revision to look up: branch, tag, or commit SHA [default: main]

      --cache-dir <DIR>
          HuggingFace hub cache directory [default: $HF_HUB_CACHE, then $HF_HOME/hub, then the platform default]

      --token <TOKEN>
          HuggingFace token for the online revision fallback [default: $HF_TOKEN, then config]

  -h, --help
          Print help
